            "detailed_description": "<strong>Trivia Night is a fun 80s themed quiz game. It has different game modes. You can play with your friend or on your own!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">   <li>Different game modes: Normal Trivia, True or False, Fun with Flags, Math, Words.<br><br>   </li><li>Gamepad Support<br><br>   </li><li>Local Multiplayer</li></ul><br>You have two options, true or false. 50% chance. Focus because you have to decide whether the statements are true or false. Time is running out!<br><br>&quot;Was this the color of this country? Was it blue? No, no. It was purple! To which country does this flag belong?&quot; Hope you remember correctly.<br><br>How good are your maths skills? Can you find all numbers in the screen on a limited time? Test yourself and find out.<br><br>How creative are you? Can you make a word by putting one letter to another word? You can play with your friends, with a bot or online.",
